15. Positive breath alcohol test upon presentation at Screening or upon Check-in at admission;
16. History of allergy or hypersensitivity to bevenopran, or related drugs;
17. For healthy subjects: positive for Hepatitis B, Hepatitis C, or human immunodeficiency virus (HIV); For renally impaired patients: positive for Hepatitis B or HIV. Patients with Hepatitis C with acceptable liver function tests (as judged by the investigator or designee) may be included;
